  "passage": "Join Our Annual Community Sports Day! The Community Sports Day is back this Saturday at Green Park. Everyone is welcome to listen to the opening speech by our mayor at 10 am sharp. Don't miss the exciting football match where our local team hopes to defeat the visitors from North Town. After the game, children can become mini-champions in fun races and win prizes. For safety, we have a first aid station with bandages and medicine ready for any minor injuries. If you get lost, look for the red signal flags near the main stage. Volunteers will insist on everyone following the rules to keep the event fun and safe for all. There will also be a book stall with a bookshelf full of interesting second-hand books for sale. All money raised will go to the local charity. Please bring your own water and snacks, as there are no duty-free shops nearby. We look forward to a fantastic day with you!",
